    "detailed_description": "<h1>ALSO RECOMMENDED FOR YOU:</h1><p><br><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728880/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1661307632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728880/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1661307632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728880/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1661307632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>CANNON is a minimalist puzzle game made with cannons that shoot balls to destroy cubes.<br><br>Tunnels will challenge you to find the right order to destroy all the cubes in the scene<br><br>The difficulty increases with several other mechanics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 progressive levels<br></li><li>Original music and effects<br></li><li>Minimalist and intuitive mechanics, use only the mouse button<br></li><li>No time, no timer and no pressure, solve the puzzles in your time<br></li><li>50 Steam Achievements</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728880/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.poster.avif?t=1661307632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728880/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.webm?t=1661307632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1728880/extras/6ffe13c922a22981f7063b07f69f9ae1.mp4?t=1661307632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>CANNON is a minimalist puzzle game made with cannons that shoot balls to destroy cubes.<br><br>Tunnels will challenge you to find the right order to destroy all the cubes in the scene<br><br>The difficulty increases with several other mechanics.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>50 progressive levels<br></li><li>Original music and effects<br></li><li>Minimalist and intuitive mechanics, use only the mouse button<br></li><li>No time, no timer and no pressure, solve the puzzles in your time<br></li><li>50 Steam Achievements</li></ul>",
